  Setting `LeafPi G H Q k`: `L : LeafSetup G Q` encodes T = T(K,g) (x = y, s = u, t = w, ℓ = l); K is the edge set
  `supp Q y u w` of `addEdge G u w` (g = `Fin.last G.m`); `S : PiSubstOn (addEdge G u w) H (supp ..) k` relates K
  to H = K^Π(𝒟); `c` is a star 5-colouring of H and `c'` the colouring of K from (A).
